{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type LoadSubsetFn = (options) => true | Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L382","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/types.ts:382"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Loads one subset and transfers its ongoing resource ownership only after\nreturning "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" or a promise. An implementation that throws synchronously\nmust release any partially acquired resource before throwing. A successful\nimplementation must await or return every receipt from the sync\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"commit()"},{"type":"text","value":" calls that establish the loaded subset. A result describes only\nthe exact "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" passed to this call."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"LoadSubsetOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LoadSubsetOptions"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype LoadSubsetFn = (options) => true | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:382](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L382)\n\nLoads one subset and transfers its ongoing resource ownership only after\nreturning `true` or a promise. An implementation that throws synchronously\nmust release any partially acquired resource before throwing. A successful\nimplementation must await or return every receipt from the sync\n`commit()` calls that establish the loaded subset. A result describes only\nthe exact `options` passed to this call.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`LoadSubsetOptions`](LoadSubsetOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`true` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: LoadSubsetFn\ntitle: LoadSubsetFn\n---\n\n```ts\ntype LoadSubsetFn = (options) => true | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:382](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L382)\n\nLoads one subset and transfers its ongoing resource ownership only after\nreturning `true` or a promise. An implementation that throws synchronously\nmust release any partially acquired resource before throwing. A successful\nimplementation must await or return every receipt from the sync\n`commit()` calls that establish the loaded subset. A result describes only\nthe exact `options` passed to this call.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`LoadSubsetOptions`](LoadSubsetOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`true` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n"}
